data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\", \"content\": \"# d002 summary\\n\\n## What was done\\n\\n1. Created `src/greet.py` with a `greet(name)` function returning `f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`.\\n2. Created `tests/test_greet.py` with two unit tests:\\n   - `test_normal_name`: asserts `greet(\\\"World\\\") == \\\"Hello, World!\\\"`\\n   - `test_empty_string`: asserts `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n3. Ran `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` from the repo root (`~/subject`).\\n   Output:\\n\\n   ```\\n   ..\\n   ----------------------------------------------------------------------\\n   Ran 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\n   OK\\n   ```\\n\\n   Exit status: `0`.\\n4. Committed both files to branch `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>` as\\n   commit `d6049f2` (\\\"Add greet function with unit tests\\\"), on top of base\\n   `1053761` (\\\"base\\\"). Working tree is clean; no other files were touched.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

